Fire a powerful shot at a foe doing [194%, 213%, 227%, 239%, 250% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.

If the creature, or any creatures in radius 3, was affected by a fear or nightmare effect it violently wakes up, shaking it off only to find itself disoriented, unable to discern friends from foes for [2, 4, 5, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.
